 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 1 - 4, use the problem and graph below.</p>\n<blockquote>\nAndre bought a new bag of cat food. The next day, he opened it to feed his cat. The graph shows how many ounces were left in the bag on the days after it was bought.   <p><img alt=\"Line on coordinate plane, origin O. Horizontal axis from 0 to 44 by 4’s, days since bag was bought. Vertical axis 0 to 64 by 8’s, ounces of cat food. Line passes through 0 comma 56 and 24 comma 16.\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"238\" src=\"exercises/media/10af62320cfa7b83.svg\" width=\"315\"><br></p>\n</blockquote>",
